  "translation": "Nyiyn iselmaden (imberrḥen) n ugellid ttwaɣlen deg wayyur amenzu, deg tlata d mraw n wussan deg-s; yettwaru akken akk i iḥkem Ḥaman i yiserdasen ixatarren n ugellid (iḥekkam n temnaḍin), i yinelmaden ɣef yal tamnaḍt, d yinedbalen n yal aɣlanu; i yal tamnaḍt s tira-s, i yal aɣlanu s tutlayt-is, s yisem n ugellid Aḥaṣweroṣ yettwaru, yebbeḍ s tbext n ugellid.",
